docs {
Submit kata TANPA LOGIN (endpoint publik, 03-api-kontribusi-verifikasi.md):
pengunjung anonim mengusulkan kata - atribusi ke user sistem Anonim
(anonim@sambasku.com), SELALU pending_review (masuk antrean review).
contributor_name opsional → contributions.guest_display_name (label
atribusi di antrean; user_id tetap Anonim).
Rate limit tamu: 20/jam per IP + 10/jam per X-Device-Id (header
opsional; tanpa header hanya bucket IP). Mute sementara per sumber →
403 ANON_CONTRIBUTION_MUTED. Teks asal-asalan → 400 UGC_INPUT_REJECTED.

Body = create-word TANPA field status (dipaksa kirim-review; draft anonim
tidak bermakna). Response bentuknya sama dengan Create Word.

201 sukses (anonim):

    {
      "success": true,
      "data": {
        "word_id": "01JDANONKATA00000000000",
        "lemma": "roboi",
        "word_type": "word",
        "status": "pending_review",
        "is_verified": false,
        "created_at": "2026-09-17T15:00:00.000Z"
      }
    }

429 kalau salah satu bucket penuh (Retry-After disertakan).
}
meta {
  name: Submit Word (Anonim)
  seq: 8
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/contributions/words
  body: json
  auth: none
}

body:json {
  {
    "language_id": "{{sambas_language_id}}",
    "lemma": "roboi",
    "contributor_name": "Contoh Kontributor",
    "meanings": [
      {
        "word_class_id": "{{word_class_id}}",
        "definition": "Istilah yang diusulkan pengunjung anonim",
        "order_index": 1,
        "translations": [
          {
            "language_id": "{{indonesia_language_id}}",
            "translation_text": "usulan anonim",
            "translation_type": "direct"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "word_type": "word",
    "category_ids": [],
    "related_words": []
  }
}

tests {
  test("201 + pending_review + is_verified false (anonim masuk antrean)", () => {
    expect(res.status).to.equal(201);
    expect(res.body.data.status).to.equal('pending_review');
    expect(res.body.data.is_verified).to.equal(false);
    expect(res.body.data.word_id).to.have.lengthOf(26);
  });
}
